{"text":"So I go to California and I start thinking, man, to do those applications again, find auditions again, put myself out there, possibly get rejected again. I'm not sure I want to do it. I kept going back and forth that I missed the deadline. My parents did not know this. Now, my parents have always been a familiar face in the audience when I was a kid doing school plays and whatnot. When I moved for college, that hasn't been a reality, but they happen to be in the audience today, so I wanted to do a quick shout out to my parents, and it's also my dad's birthday. Now, birthday boy over there once helped us, Sudanese refugee family moved to California. And in that process, one of their five children was left behind, and my dad made it a priority to bring them together, to reunite them. And since then, they've always been so grateful to my family, they are so welcoming to us, and don't take anything for granted is what I've learned, just being in a home of a refugee aid worker.","words":[{"text":"So","start":0.0,"end":0.68},{"text":"I","start":0.68,"end":0.8},{"text":"go","start":0.8,"end":0.94},{"text":"to","start":0.94,"end":1.1},{"text":"California","start":1.1,"end":1.56},{"text":"and","start":1.56,"end":2.18},{"text":"I","start":2.18,"end":2.32},{"text":"start","start":2.32,"end":2.5},{"text":"thinking","start":2.5,"end":2.92,"punct":","},{"text":"man","start":3.32,"end":3.34,"punct":","},{"text":"to","start":3.96,"end":4.18},{"text":"do","start":4.18,"end":4.3},{"text":"those","start":4.3,"end":4.48},{"text":"applications","start":4.48,"end":5.14},{"text":"again","start":5.14,"end":5.68,"punct":","},{"text":"find","start":5.92,"end":6.14},{"text":"auditions","start":6.14,"end":6.66},{"text":"again","start":6.66,"end":7.08,"punct":","},{"text":"put","start":7.2,"end":7.42},{"text":"myself","start":7.42,"end":7.72},{"text":"out","start":7.72,"end":8.12},{"text":"there","start":8.12,"end":8.36,"punct":","},{"text":"possibly","start":8.5,"end":8.76},{"text":"g